WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,980
Come in quickly. This is good.

2
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:15,340
Can't do it

3
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,900
Don't even think about it

4
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,620
